msgid "How customer data is encrypted and how users can delete their personal data."
msgstr "Cara data pelanggan dienkripsi dan cara pengguna bisa menghapus data pribadi mereka."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Securing your data"
msgstr "Mengamankan datamu"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Securing your data {#securing-your-data}"
msgstr "Mengamankan datamu {#securing-your-data}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To ensure that you can securely manage your data when you use IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, it is important to know exactly what data is stored and encrypted and how you can delete any stored data.\n"
msgstr "Untuk memastikan kamu bisa mengelola datamu dengan aman saat menggunakan IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, penting untuk mengetahui data apa saja yang disimpan dan dienkripsi, serta bagaimana cara menghapus data yang tersimpan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Protecting your sensitive data {#protecting-your-sensitive-data}"
msgstr "Melindungi data sensitifmu {#protecting-your-sensitive-data}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The data that you store in IBM Cloud&reg; is encrypted at rest by using a randomly generated key.\n"
msgstr "Data yang kamu simpan di IBM Cloud&reg; dienkripsi saat disimpan (at rest) menggunakan kunci yang dibuat secara acak.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deleting your data {#deleting-your-data}"
msgstr "Menghapus datamu {#deleting-your-data}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deleting a service instance removes all of the content associated with that instance, such as your jobs, results, parameters, and programs. To delete an instance, from the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), find the instance you want to remove, click its overflow menu, then click **Delete**. You will be asked to confirm the deletion.\n"
msgstr "Menghapus instance layanan akan menghapus semua konten yang terkait dengan instance tersebut, seperti job, hasil, parameter, dan program. Untuk menghapus instance, dari [halaman Instances,](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) temukan instance yang ingin dihapus, klik menu overflow-nya, lalu klik **Delete**. Kamu akan diminta untuk mengonfirmasi penghapusan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have a Manager role, you can also delete an individual job and its data. See more about access policies, groups, and roles in the [documentation](/guides/access-groups).\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu memiliki peran Manager, kamu juga bisa menghapus job individual beserta datanya. Lihat selengkapnya tentang kebijakan akses, grup, dan peran di [dokumentasi](/guides/access-groups).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data retention policy {#data-retention-policy}"
msgstr "Kebijakan retensi data {#data-retention-policy}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM will retain your (undeleted) data for three years while you are a current user of the service. To find information about how long data is retained by IBM after you stop using the service, see the [IBM Quantum Compute Service data sheet](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=BB6EE1D06BDE11EBA199CCFE56FA6D9D), found on the IBM Terms site.\n"
msgstr "IBM akan menyimpan datamu (yang belum dihapus) selama tiga tahun sepanjang kamu masih menjadi pengguna layanan ini. Untuk mengetahui informasi tentang berapa lama data disimpan oleh IBM setelah kamu berhenti menggunakan layanan, lihat [IBM Quantum Compute Service data sheet](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=BB6EE1D06BDE11EBA199CCFE56FA6D9D), yang tersedia di situs IBM Terms.\n"
